      "confirmed": "Whole source: default8x8 loop x!=0&&y!=0 emits49bits, not documented64; average excludes DC only but bit loop excludes entire row0/col0. Full image decode before32resize, no resource cap; ImageIO.read null unsupported input not handled, only IOException caught by URL wrapper. Full DCT4nestedloops O(size^4), scaling coefficient /4 fixed32 convention irrespective customsize, no validation0<smaller<=size. URL stream has no explicit timeouts/size bounds; cache mutable/unbounded keyed URL not content, shared ColorConvertOp/HashMap no synchronization, I/O failure EMPTY vs cache-only missing null inconsistent. External code attribution Elliott Shepherd/StackOverflow present, nested provenance unresolved; not same native pHash problematic execution, Java not run, no adoption."
    },
